# Creeping Tar Pit is played on turn 1 (it enters tapped) with three Moxen, and on turn 3 Bot1 animates it with them: it is
# a 3/2 blue and black Elemental creature that is still a land, and it can't be blocked, so Bot2's Llanowar Elves may
# not block it and it deals 3 (another attacker is there so that Bot2 is asked to block at all). The effect ends in the cleanup step, leaving a plain Land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Creeping Tar Pit
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Forest x17

